ehavior, measure campaign performance, and improve marketing strategies for better engagement and business growth.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Job Responsibilities:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Analyzing marketing campaigns and performance metrics<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Studying customer behavior and market trends<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Measuring ROI and campaign effectiveness<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Creating reports and dashboards for marketing teams<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Supporting data-driven marketing decisions<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Required Skills:<\/strong><\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Knowledge of marketing analytics<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Proficiency in Excel and data analysis<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Understanding of customer segmentation<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Analytical and communication skills<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tools Used:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Google Analytics, Excel, SQL, Power BI, and Tableau<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Average Salary:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>In India, a Marketing Analyst typically earns around <a href=\"https:\/\/in.indeed.com\/career\/marketing-analyst\/salaries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">\u20b94,28,123<\/a> annually, while professionals in the US earn an average annual salary of nearly <a href=\"https:\/\/www.indeed.com\/career\/marketing-analyst\/salaries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">$79,951<\/a>, depending on experience, skills, and organization.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">7. Operations Analyst<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>An Operations Analyst evaluates business processes and operational data to improve efficiency, reduce costs, and enhance performance. They analyze workflows, identify gaps, and recommend practical solutions that help organizations operate smoothly and achieve strategic goals.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Job Responsibilities:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Analyzing operational processes and performance metrics<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Identifying inefficiencies and improvement opportunities<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Preparing reports and performance dashboards<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Supporting cost-reduction and productivity initiatives<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Collaborating with different departments to optimize workflows<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Required Skills:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Strong analytical and problem-solving skills<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Knowledge of Excel and SQL<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Understanding of business operations<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Communication and reporting skills<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tools Used:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Microsoft Excel, SQL, Power BI, and Tableau<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Average Salary:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>In the US, Operations Analysts earn an average salary of <a href=\"https:\/\/www.indeed.com\/career\/operations-analyst\/salaries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">$79,109<\/a> per year, while in India, the average annual salary is approximately <a href=\"https:\/\/in.indeed.com\/career\/operations-analyst\/salaries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">\u20b94,99,802<\/a>, depending on experience, skills, industry, and organization.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">8. Quantitative Analyst<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>A Quantitative Analyst analyzes financial and statistical data to develop mathematical models that support investment strategies, risk management, and financial decision-making in banking and financial institutions.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Job Responsibilities:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Developing financial and risk assessment models<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Analyzing market trends and financial data<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Supporting investment and trading strategies<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Evaluating